OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FPartly cloudy to start with
OL,6,Fisolated light showers mostly around
OL,7,Fthe coast and over the Pennines
OL,8,Finitially. Cloud infilling with
OL,9,Fshowers becoming more widespread but
OL,10,Fremaining mostly light with many areas
OL,11,Fremaining dry. Temperatures around
OL,12,Faverage.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FCloudy with bands of mostly
OL,15,Flight rain moving in from the
OL,16,Fnorthwest through the evening and
OL,17,Fovernight. The rain bands clear by
OL,18,FThursday morning. Temperatures near
OL,19,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
