OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FGenerally clear and dry to
OL,6,Fstart the day but with cloud building
OL,7,Fand showers developing through the
OL,8,Fmorning onwards, heaviest over the
OL,9,Fhills. Feeling cooler in fresh
OL,10,Fwesterly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRemaining
OL,13,Funsettled to start the period with
OL,14,Ffurther rain and blustery winds
OL,15,Fthrough Friday and into Saturday.
OL,16,FTurning drier and brighter on Sunday.
OL,17,FTemperatures remain around average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
